From: Michael-CY Lee <michael-cy.lee@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Oct 2024 17:44:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: fix key use-after-free

Fix the issue that the key might be used in TX path after being freed.

Signed-off-by: Michael-CY Lee <michael-cy.lee@mediatek.com>
---
 mt76_connac_mac.c |    3 +--
 1 files changed, 1 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/mt76_connac_mac.c
+++ b/mt76_connac_mac.c
@@ -462,8 +462,7 @@ mt76_connac2_mac_write_txwi_80211(struct
 	      FIELD_PREP(MT_TXD2_SUB_TYPE, fc_stype) |
 	      FIELD_PREP(MT_TXD2_MULTICAST, multicast);
 
-	if (key && multicast && ieee80211_is_robust_mgmt_frame(skb) &&
-	    key->cipher == WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_AES_CMAC) {
+	if (key && multicast && ieee80211_is_robust_mgmt_frame(skb)) {
 		val |= MT_TXD2_BIP;
 		txwi[3] &= ~cpu_to_le32(MT_TXD3_PROTECT_FRAME);
 	}
